      en: ["La Perla was officially inaugurated on October 25, 2016.", "The Ferris wheel reaches a peak height of 57 meters (187 feet).", "It features 36 enclosed, air-conditioned cabins for passenger comfort.", "One full rotation of the wheel takes approximately 12 minutes.", "The total capacity of the wheel is 216 people per cycle.", "The lighting system uses programmable LEDs to create various visual effects."],
